    "changes": "Adapted the seven stat blocks of issue #178 (Young Copper Dragon, Young Gold Dragon, Young Green Dragon, Young Red Dragon, Young Silver Dragon, Young White Dragon and Zombie; PDF pages 276, 291, 293–294, 318, 324, 340 and 343–344) into typed mechanical fields and implementation keys. Trait and action entries keep their source rules text, rejoined across line, column and page breaks; descriptive prose outside the stat blocks is omitted. The Young White Dragon’s Intelligence saving throw is printed as 2, without its minus sign; the record keeps -2, the value the modifier gives. No playable NPC behavior is granted."
